abstract: "Replication code and derived-data aggregates for a study showing that the apparent positive relationship between idiosyncratic volatility (entropy) and returns in large-cap equity panels is a survivorship artifact, using a survivorship-corrected full-universe panel constructed from Sharadar SF1. Raw third-party fundamental data (Sharadar SF1) are not redistributed; see README for data-access terms."
